  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Original low-poly interpretation of the shell exterior and visible aperture of PRI 69688, not an exact scan or living-animal reconstruction. UF 247451 is corroborating species morphology only, not the source of this specimen scale. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 28, \"width_x\": 30, \"depth_y\": 25}, \"basis\": \"PRI69688 three-view photograph: its 5 mm vertical bar is about 39 px; shell image height roughly 220 px gives approximately 28 mm. Width/depth are working estimates from oblique views, not caliper measurements.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Approximate visual scale; allow about 15% proportional interpretation. No specimen-exact biometric claim. Do not use the distinct 4 cm UF247451 scale or PRI70745 3.5 cm as PRI69688 measurements.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：Original low-poly interpretation of the shell exterior and visible aperture of PRI 69688, not an exact scan or living-animal reconstruction. UF 247451 is corroborating species morphology only, not the source of this specimen scale. {\"unit\": \"meters\", \"working_dimensions_mm\": {\"height_z\": 28, \"width_x\": 30, \"depth_y\": 25}, \"basis\": \"PRI69688 three-view photograph: its 5 mm vertical bar is about 39 px; shell image height roughly 220 px gives approximately 28 mm. Width/depth are working estimates from oblique views, not caliper measurements.\", \"uncertainty\": \"Approximate visual scale; allow about 15% proportional interpretation. No specimen-exact biometric claim. Do not use the distinct 4 cm UF247451 scale or PRI70745 3.5 cm as PRI69688 measurements.\"}"
